config ZLRS_PROTO
	bool "zlrs protocol core"
	help
	  Pure C protocol core: CRC, FHSS, UID and (to be added) framing,
	  serial segmentation and the link state machine. It has no Zephyr
	  dependency so it can also be built and tested on the host, see
	  tests/host.

